  "contentHtml": "<P>서울 원묵중학교 송병근 선생님께서 개발하신 인성교육자료입니다.<BR><BR>재량활동이나 학급운영에 활용할 아이디어가 많습니다.<BR><BR>광수생각이라는 좋은 소재를 그리고 수많은 책에서 가져온 구구절절 가슴에 와닿는 글귀들을 <BR><BR>이렇게 학교 현장에 멋지게 활용하고 계신 선생님의 아이디어와 노력에 박수를 보냅니다.<BR><BR>좋은 자료 공유해주신 송병근 선생님, <BR>고맙습니다. </P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><STRONG><FONT style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #66e8ff\" color=#000000><U><A class=tx-link href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2dYVtIKoNjpU1lqLU40T1pVU28/edit?usp=sharing\" target=_blank>광수생각 클릭!</A></U></FONT></STRONG></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">정말 좋은 자료네요..너무 감사합니다. ^^</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 여민주 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2008-10-13</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">좋은 자료 고맙습니다.</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 권기순 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2008-12-12</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">좋은 자료 잘 활용할께요. 고맙습니다.</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 이명덕 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-03-25</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">정말 감사합니다. </TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 이수정 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-04-15</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">와우.. 정말 좋은 자료네용... 잘 활용하겠습니다. 너무 감사해용...</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 박지현 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-08-31</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">좋은 자료 감사해요!! 정말 잘 활용하겠습니다!! </TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 서정하 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-12-21</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">너무 감사해요.. 아이들과 할 수 있는 자료가 너~~~~무 많네요</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 이명주 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2010-03-30</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">찾고 있었던 건데..감사합니다..잘 쓸게요..</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 백수경 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2010-04-14</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">몇년만에 담임을 맡았습니다. 정말 학생들의 인성교육에 딱인자료네요. 감사히 잘 활용할께요.</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 김한희 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2012-03-02</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
